DESCRIPTION >
    - `repository_star_snapshot_bounds_ds` keeps, per repository, its first and last star snapshot and the star count of the last one.
    - Populated by `repository_star_snapshot_bounds_MV.pipe` on every insert into `repositoryStarSnapshots`.
    - Read by `stars_github_as_of.pipe` for repositories with no snapshot in the days before a cutoff: 0 before the first snapshot, the last count after the last one.

SCHEMA >
    `repositoryId` String,
    `firstCapturedAt` SimpleAggregateFunction(min, DateTime64(3)),
    `lastCapturedAt` SimpleAggregateFunction(max, DateTime64(3)),
    `lastStarCountState` AggregateFunction(argMax, Int32, Tuple(DateTime64(3), DateTime64(3)))

ENGINE AggregatingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY repositoryId
